  "uncoveredCases": [
    {
      "name": "verified-proxy-fetch-exhaustion-object-identity",
      "reason": "Uncovered by shared JSON vectors: production uses a private WeakSet object-identity brand for terminal proxyFetch exhaustion. A JSON boolean/string cannot prove that provenance. Current branded errors also expose the legacy proxy_unreachable hint, which is covered separately; a brand-only wrapper with that hint removed needs an integration-level test that obtains the real branded object."
    }
